# slider-parked-left (h8-points-slider): query p=-50. P lies left of the
# visible range: the thumb parks at the track's left end (left 9px) with the
# dashed parked mark, data-parked="left". At rest, no tip.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query p=-50
wait 500
shot slider-parked-left
